{'symbol': 'SO', 'date': '2021-12-07 14:40:00', 'title': 'ALABAMA POWER RECEIVES APPROVAL FOR SOLAR PROJECT IN LOWNDES COUNTY', 'text': 'BIRMINGHAM, ALA., DEC. 7, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- ALABAMA POWER AND MERCEDES BENZ U.S. INTERNATIONAL INC. (MBUSI) RECEIVED APPROVAL TODAY FROM THE ALABAMA PUBLIC SERVICE COMMISSION FOR THE PROPOSED 80-MEGAWATT LETOHATCHEE SOLAR PROJECT IN LOWNDES COUNTY, SOUTH OF MONTGOMERY.'}